spice
* SPICE Netlist
* Node 0 is considered as ground

R1 3 0 R1_value
R2 3 2 R2_value
R3 1 3 R3_value
C1 3 0 C1_value

* Input and Output
Vin 1 0 DC 0V
Vout 2 0

* Op-Amp
* Op-amp model 
.subckt opamp 3 2 
* connections for inverting input, non-inverting input, and output

.end

XU1 3 2 opamp

.end